    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>17级 杂兵 控制</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 精界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +14</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 31，''强韧'' 27，''反射'' 30，''意志'' 29</span><span>''侦查'' +18</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}捣蛋气场✦灵气 5{{$:/dnd/images/five}}</div>\n<div class=description>在该灵气内的敌人的技能检定受到-5 减值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+22vs.AC<br>命中：12 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}跌倒✦随意（一轮一次）</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 5（一个生物）+20vs.意志<br>命中：该捣蛋精淘气鬼滑移目标 3 格并击倒它。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（捣蛋精）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+19，盗术+19</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+11）</span><span>''敏捷'' 22（+14）</span><span>''感知'' 21（+13）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 19（+12）</span><span>''智力'' 20（+13）</span><span>''魅力'' 16（+11）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语，地精语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
